{
  "uid": "myyoutube-business-discovery",
  "title": "MyYoutube 搜索与推荐",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "15s",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "tags": [
    "MyYoutube",
    "业务"
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "业务总览",
      "url": "/d/myyoutube-business-overview",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "title": "各链路看板",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "业务"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "title": "内容单笔事件",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:15601/app/dashboards#/view/myyoutube-business-flow",
      "targetBlank": true
    },
    {
      "title": "上传准备单笔事件",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:15601/app/dashboards#/view/myyoutube-upload-flow",
      "targetBlank": true
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "instance",
        "label": "实例",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(up{job=\"myyoutube-java\"}, instance)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "口径与排障入口",
      "type": "text",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "查询 → 召回 → 融合 → 可读结果。空结果单独统计，可能来自深分页或正常无命中；降级可能与正常返回同时发生。\n\n统计单位为操作调用/尝试，包含重试和幂等重放，不是去重用户数、内容数或端到端成功率。无流量、未接入、采样失败或过期显示无数据，不补零。\n\nsuccess=正常返回；empty=返回空列表/空页；no_change=条件未命中；business_error=BizException（含业务校验，也可能包装基础设施故障）；failure=其他异常或事务回滚。"
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "业务操作接入状态",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "1 表示此实例已登记业务埋点；同时检查服务抓取状态。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "myyoutube_business_operation_enabled{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",chain=\"discovery\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}} · {{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "各操作完成速率及结果",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "统计单位为操作调用/尝试，包含重试和幂等重放，不是去重用户数、内容数或端到端成功率。无流量、未接入、采样失败或过期显示无数据，不补零。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(operation,outcome) (rate(myyoutube_business_operations_total{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",chain=\"discovery\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}} · {{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "所选时段调用完成量",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "按计数器增量统计，自动处理进程重启；窗口开始前需要有抓取样本。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(operation,outcome) (increase(myyoutube_business_operations_total{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",chain=\"discovery\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}} · {{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "正常返回比例（含空结果和条件未命中）",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "无调用时没有有效比例；不是整条链路成功率。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(operation) (increase(myyoutube_business_operations_total{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",chain=\"discovery\",outcome=~\"success|empty|no_change\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum by(operation) (increase(myyoutube_business_operations_total{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",chain=\"discovery\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "操作耗时 P95",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "同步方法调用至事务最终完成；不包含后续异步业务耗时。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by(le,operation) (rate(myyoutube_business_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",chain=\"discovery\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "当前在途调用",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "包含等待外层事务完成的操作。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(operation) (myyoutube_business_inflight{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",chain=\"discovery\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 7,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "业务异常与系统异常",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "success=正常返回；empty=返回空列表/空页；no_change=条件未命中；business_error=BizException（含业务校验，也可能包装基础设施故障）；failure=其他异常或事务回滚。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(operation,outcome) (increase(myyoutube_business_operations_total{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",chain=\"discovery\",outcome=~\"business_error|failure\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}} · {{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 8,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "搜索和推荐空页 / 空列表次数",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "返回页为空，不等同于全部召回为空。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(operation) (increase(myyoutube_business_operations_total{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",chain=\"discovery\",outcome=\"empty\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 9,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "搜索召回降级次数",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(strategy) (increase(myyoutube_search_recall_failures_total{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{strategy}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 10,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 38,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "推荐 CF 降级次数",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(strategy) (increase(myyoutube_recommend_fallbacks_total{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{strategy}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 11,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 38,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "热搜采集结果",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "accepted=Redis 已接收；filtered=输入被过滤；capacity=分区容量满；rejected=线程池拒绝；failure=写 Redis 失败。不是最终落库量。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(outcome) (rate(myyoutube_hot_search_records_total{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 12,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 46,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "热搜缓存读取与降级",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "hot=榜单，named=向量复用；miss 是正常无命中，timeout/rejected/failure 是降级，budget 是调用前预算已耗尽。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(kind,outcome) (increase(myyoutube_hot_search_cache_reads_total{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}} · {{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 13,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 46,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "热搜后台操作失败",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "refresh 正常返回可能仍有部分词或落库延后；同时检查模型、贡献、写库、确认和汇总各子步骤。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(operation) (increase(myyoutube_hot_search_duration_seconds_count{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",outcome=\"failure\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 14,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 54,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "热搜后台操作耗时 P95",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "含成功和失败尝试，桶上界 120 秒；超出范围的耗时需结合日志与 duration sum/count。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by(le,operation) (rate(myyoutube_hot_search_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 15,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 54,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "热搜模型条目处理结果",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "仅统计已返回的模型批次；unassigned 表示该批未返回有效向量或分组的输入条目，完整调用失败见操作失败面板。重试会重复计数。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(operation,outcome) (increase(myyoutube_hot_search_model_items_total{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}} · {{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 16,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 62,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "热搜历史写入与确认尝试",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "committed=批量事务返回成功；acknowledged=随后 Redis 确认成功；deferred=保留重试；excluded=归组前被过滤并确认。包含幂等重放，四项不能相加为去重事件总量。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(outcome) (increase(myyoutube_hot_search_history_events_total{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 17,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 62,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "热搜待处理事件",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "各输入分区有效期内事件数量之和，同一 Redis 的多副本用 max，不能相加。采样不包含已过三天边界的记录。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max (myyoutube_hot_search_pending{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\"} and on(instance) (pipeline_metrics_sample_enabled{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",component=\"hot_search\"} == 1) and on(instance) (pipeline_metrics_sample_success{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",component=\"hot_search\"} == 1) and on(instance) (pipeline_metrics_sample_age_seconds{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",component=\"hot_search\"} <= 90))",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "id": 18,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 70,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "热搜最老待处理时间",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max (myyoutube_hot_search_pending_oldest_seconds{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\"} and on(instance) (pipeline_metrics_sample_enabled{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",component=\"hot_search\"} == 1) and on(instance) (pipeline_metrics_sample_success{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",component=\"hot_search\"} == 1) and on(instance) (pipeline_metrics_sample_age_seconds{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",component=\"hot_search\"} <= 90))",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "id": 19,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 70,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "热搜共享榜单剩余有效期",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "共享 Redis 快照 TTL；0 表示缺失、过期或没有有效 TTL。未采样、采样失败或超过 90 秒不展示旧值。",
